# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Environment variables. `.env.example` is the committed template; every real
# env file stays local. Vite inlines VITE_ variables into the bundle, so these
# must never hold a secret even when ignored - but an ignored file also stops
# a local API URL or flag from being pushed by accident.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

